hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20594","Hajjaj narrated to us, Shu'bah narrated to us, Qatadah informed me, and Bahz said: And Shu'bah narrated to me, from Qatadah, he said: I heard Zurarah ibn Awfa narrating from Ubayy ibn Malik, from the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, that he said: Whoever reaches his parents or one of them, then enters the Fire after that, may Allah distance him and crush him."
